# The laser sight's colour (wish of the project owner, 04.11.2026: the app menu, CONTROLS, LASER SIGHT: Default (Red),
# Blue, Green, Yellow). The game makes two effects for the sight each frame: the beam (EspDrawLaserLine, est 3, a
# GX line in the effect's colour) and the dot (drawPoint, est 0x50). Right after it set them up, the port's
# re4_laser_tint (runtime/laser_colour.cpp) turns their colours to the chosen one; with Default (Red) it does
# nothing, the picture is the game's.
# Not a bug of the prototype: a port feature.
